# ─── Supabase Auth (required for sign-in) ───────────────────────────────
# Get these from supabase.com → Your Project → Settings → API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGci...

# ─── Optional: real Claude AI scheduling ────────────────────────────────
# Without this, the app uses a smart built-in scheduler
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ─── Setup Instructions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# 1. Create a free Supabase project: https://supabase.com
# 2. Copy URL + anon key above
# 3. In Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Providers:
#    - Enable Google (requires Google Cloud OAuth client)
#    - Enable Apple (requires Apple Developer account)
#    - Enable GitHub (requires GitHub OAuth app)
#    - Email is enabled by default
# 4. Set redirect URL in each provider to:
#    https://your-vercel-url.vercel.app/auth/callback
# 5. Also add https://your-vercel-url.vercel.app/auth/callback
#    to Supabase → Authentication → URL Configuration → Redirect URLs
# 6. Deploy!
